- c. Construct a utility function with the property that the ratio of the partial derivatives at the bundle  $(x_1, x_2)$  is  $\sqrt{x_2}/\sqrt{x_1}$ .
- d. Calculate the indirect utility function derived from this utility function. Do you arrive at the original  $v(p_1, p_2, w)$ ? If not, can the original indirect utility function still be derived from another utility function satisfying the property in (c)?

