  A3 If  $D(h) = D(h')$ , then this will also be the decision following the concatenation of  $h$  and  $h'$ . (Reminder: The concatenation of  $h = (F, S)$  and  $h' = (S, S, F)$  is  $(F, S, S, S, F)$ ).
